                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "This week, try one simple experiment, and if you feel like it, <strong>send me a photo</strong> :)<br><br>Make one meal the way traditional kitchens always have: beans with spices, greens with olive oil and garlic, rice with something pickled. Nothing fancy. Just food that has quietly worked for a long time.",
